  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with sesame seeds, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and browned around the edges, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f921e791a0616c0b2fceee/step-1b1a3e42.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f921e791a0616c0b2fceee/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Trim green beans and cut in half. Cut carrot into thin sticks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Stir-fry carrot, beans and a splash of water until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in hoisin, soy sauce, brown sugar, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and a splash of water. Cook until bubbling, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f921e791a0616c0b2fceee/step-08000b69.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir cauliflower through the mixed veggies.\n• Divide garlic rice and veggies between bowls.\n• Top with crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f921e791a0616c0b2fceee/step-e568406a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
